  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"410\" data-original-width=\"449\" height=\"183\" src=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔸מַחֲרִישׁ לָדַעַת - מִשְׁתָּאֵה<br data-end=\"197\" data-start=\"194\" />🔸מַחֲרִישׁ בְּזַעַם - בַּשָּׂדֶה<br data-end=\"232\" data-start=\"229\" />🔸מַחֲרִישׁ אוִיל - מִשְׁתַּוֶּה<br />🔸מַחֲרִישׁ האב - קָם זֶה</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ביאור<i>:</i></span></p><p data-end=\"296\" data-start=\"109\" style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אליעזר שתק - עד שידע האם רבקה ראויה להיות אשה ליצחק.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יעקב שתק - עד שוב בניו מהשדה, לקחת נקם מאנשי שכם על אונס דינה.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">האוויל שתק - ובכך נדמה לכולם כבעל חכמה (עפ\"י מִשְׁלֵי).</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שתק האב - והקים בזאת את נדר בתו.</span></li></ol><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; background-color: white; border: 0px; box-sizing: inherit; direction: rtl; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אם חשבת - אל תאמר.</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; background-color: white; border: 0px; box-sizing: inherit; direction: rtl; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אם אמרת - אל תכתוב.</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; background-color: white; border: 0px; box-sizing: inherit; direction: rtl; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variation-settings: inh