x; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'<b style=\"font-size: medium;\">לְעַנֹּת</b>' / '<span style=\"font-size: medium;\">לְסַגָּפָא</span>'<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: medium;\">למנוע צרכים - לְהִסְתַּגֵּף</span></li><li style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; counter-increment: templateify 1; list-style: none; margin: 8px 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'<b style=\"font-size: medium;\">לַצָּבָא</b>' / '<span style=\"font-size: medium;\">לְחֵילָא</span>'<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></span>❖&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: medium;\">להיות חייל - לְהִתְחַיֵּל</span></li><li style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; counter-increment: templateify 1; list-style: none; margin: 8px 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'<b style=\"font-size: medium;\">וַיַּהַרְגוּ</b>' / '<span style=\"font-size: medium;\">וּקְטַלוּ</span>'