 outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></h2><div style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/bbf25850ff2421f2b1.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"הבת שנדרה נדר - מביטה באביה בדאגה - בעוד הוא מביט בשעון החול\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"/assets/images/content/bbf25850ff2421f2b1.png\" width=\"133\" /></a></div><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: arial; text-align: center;\">וְהֶחֱרִישׁ לָהּ אָבִיהָ - וְקָמוּ כָּל נְדָרֶיהָ</span></div></span></div></div></div>"
